  "user_request_original": "Design a periodic multilayer stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack structure: Air | (hfo2 | SiO2 (Lemarchand))_8 | SiO2 (Lemarchand) substrate, totaling 16 layers. Optimize the quarter-wave reference wavelength and a uniform thickness scale factor to maximize transmission in 1000-1700 nm band and reflection in 300-450 nm band. Use only hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) materials. Evaluate performance at normal incidence, unpolarized light.",
